  ⚠ angular-template(attributes-order): The element's attributes/bindings did not match the expected order: expected `#box`, `[(ngModel)]` instead of `[(ngModel)]`, `#box`
   ╭─[attributes_order.html:1:8]
 1 │ <input bindon-ngModel="v" #box>
   ·        ───────────────────────
   ╰────
  help: Replace `bindon-ngModel="v" #box` with `#box bindon-ngModel="v"`.

  ⚠ angular-template(attributes-order): The element's attributes/bindings did not match the expected order: expected `#t`, `[(x)]` instead of `[(x)]`, `#t`
   ╭─[attributes_order.html:1:14]
 1 │ <ng-template [(x)]="y" #t></ng-template>
   ·              ────────────
   ╰────
  help: Replace `[(x)]="y" #t` with `#t [(x)]="y"`.

  ⚠ angular-template(attributes-order): The element's attributes/bindings did not match the expected order: expected `href`, `let-a`, `let-b` instead of `let-b`, `href`, `let-a`
   ╭─[attributes_order.html:1:14]
 1 │ <ng-template let-b href="x" let-a></ng-template>
   ·              ────────────────────
   ╰────
  help: Replace `let-b href="x" let-a` with `href="x" let-a let-b`.

  ⚠ angular-template(attributes-order): The element's attributes/bindings did not match the expected order: expected `#box`, `class`, `[value]`, `(input)` instead of `(input)`, `[value]`, `class`, `#box`
   ╭─[attributes_order.html:1:8]
 1 │ <input (input)="search()" [value]="query" class="search" #box>
   ·        ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   ╰────
  help: Replace `(input)="search()" [value]="query" class="search" #box` with `#box class="search" [value]="query" (input)="search()"`.

  ⚠ angular-template(attributes-order): The element's attributes/bindings did not match the expected order: expected `*ngIf`, `class` instead of `class`, `*ngIf`
   ╭─[attributes_order.html:1:6]
 1 │ <div class="a" *ngIf="x"></div>
   ·      ───────────────────
   ╰────
  help: Replace `class="a" *ngIf="x"` with `*ngIf="x" class="a"`.

  ⚠ angular-template(attributes-order): The element's attributes/bindings did not match the expected order: expected `*ngFor`, `class`, `[b]` instead of `[b]`, `*ngFor`, `class`
   ╭─[attributes_order.html:1:6]
 1 │ <div [b]="c" *ngFor="let x of xs" class="a"></div>
   ·      ──────────────────────────────────────
   ╰────
  help: Replace `[b]="c" *ngFor="let x of xs" class="a"` with `*ngFor="let x of xs" class="a" [b]="c"`.

  ⚠ angular-template(attributes-order): The element's attributes/bindings did not match the expected order: expected `[(ngModel)]`, `(click)` instead of `(click)`, `[(ngModel)]`
   ╭─[attributes_order.html:1:6]
 1 │ <div (click)="x()" [(ngModel)]="m"></div>
   ·      ─────────────────────────────
   ╰────
  help: Replace `(click)="x()" [(ngModel)]="m"` with `[(ngModel)]="m" (click)="x()"`.

  ⚠ angular-template(attributes-order): The element's attributes/bindings did not match the expected order: expected `title`, `alt` instead of `alt`, `title`
   ╭─[attributes_order.html:1:6]
 1 │ <img alt="a" title="{{ t }}">
   ·      ───────────────────────
   ╰────
  help: Replace `alt="a" title="{{ t }}"` with `title="{{ t }}" alt="a"`.

  ⚠ angular-template(attributes-order): The element's attributes/bindings did not match the expected order: expected `class`, `href` instead of `href`, `class`
   ╭─[attributes_order.html:1:4]
