   ·    ──────────────────
   ╰────
  help: Replace `href="x" class="y"` with `class="y" href="x"`.

  ⚠ angular-template(attributes-order): The element's attributes/bindings did not match the expected order: expected `alpha`, `i18n-alpha`, `[beta]`, `i18n-beta`, `[gamma]` instead of `[beta]`, `alpha`, `[gamma]`, `i18n-alpha`, `i18n-beta`
   ╭─[attributes_order.html:1:6]
